PE 789: Minimal pairing modulo p / 模p最小配对

=== Forced inverse pairing costs ===
  p= 3: cost =        3  (self-inverses: 1 2 )
  p= 5: cost =       10  (self-inverses: 1 4 )
  p= 7: cost =       21  (self-inverses: 1 6 )
  p=11: cost =       55  (self-inverses: 1 10 )
  p=13: cost =       78  (self-inverses: 1 12 )
  p=17: cost =      136  (self-inverses: 1 16 )
  p=19: cost =      171  (self-inverses: 1 18 )
  p=23: cost =      253  (self-inverses: 1 22 )

=== Pairing with (a, p-a) ===
  p= 5: Σ(a·(p-a) mod p) = 5
  p= 7: Σ(a·(p-a) mod p) = 14
  p=11: Σ(a·(p-a) mod p) = 33
  p=13: Σ(a·(p-a) mod p) = 39
  p=17: Σ(a·(p-a) mod p) = 68
  p=19: Σ(a·(p-a) mod p) = 95

=== Sum of a + a^{-1} for each pair ===
  p= 5: sum = 5  (= 2 per pair avg)
  p= 7: sum = 14  (= 4 per pair avg)
  p=11: sum = 44  (= 8 per pair avg)
  p=13: sum = 65  (= 10 per pair avg)

=== Cumulative sum over primes ===
  Σ cost for primes p ≤ 30: 1134
